WEBVTT

﻿1

00:00:23.774 --> 00:00:25.233
First Avenue, Kabuki-cho


00:00:48.257 --> 00:00:52.593
- Are you sure, Mr. Fujiwara?
- You know what the boss said.


00:00:52.803 --> 00:00:55.012
He doesn't need a bodyguard.


00:00:55.013 --> 00:00:58.182
At least not in the apartment.


00:00:59.643 --> 00:01:02.061
But why not let me keep
a look-out outside his door?


00:01:02.229 --> 00:01:04.397
While he's fucking a girl?


00:01:06.567 --> 00:01:07.400
That's not what I mean.


00:01:09.236 --> 00:01:13.948
You're only a bodyguard, so just
shut the fuck up until you're needed.


00:01:23.584 --> 00:01:24.250
Hello.


00:01:27.045 --> 00:01:28.212
Is that you, Takeshi?


00:01:29.631 --> 00:01:32.759
You're coming home soon, aren't you?


00:01:32.760 --> 00:01:35.845
You're not leaving too, are you?


00:01:36.013 --> 00:01:38.931
No Takeshi, I won't leave you.
I'm at work.


00:01:38.932 --> 00:01:41.058
- I'll call back later.
- Dad, Dad...


00:01:52.321 --> 00:01:53.738
Tadanobu Asano


00:01:55.616 --> 00:01:56.866
Hideo Yamamoto


00:01:59.745 --> 00:02:01.120
Takashi Miike


00:02:08.337 --> 00:02:09.378
Stop it. No!


00:02:13.175 --> 00:02:13.591
No!


00:02:14.384 --> 00:02:16.219
Cut it out.


00:02:20.766 --> 00:02:22.099
No!


00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:30.358
Stop it, please.


00:02:30.359 --> 00:02:31.943
How does that feel?


00:03:04.601 --> 00:03:05.309
Who's there?


00:03:07.938 --> 00:03:08.646
Who the hell...!


00:03:38.093 --> 00:03:41.637
Ichi the Killer


00:03:41.972 --> 00:03:43.306
Hi, Myu-Myu?


00:03:44.683 --> 00:03:46.225
It's me.


00:03:48.103 --> 00:03:51.063
- Inoue, don't!
- I thought I'd strengthen my resolve


00:03:51.315 --> 00:03:54.233
No need.
Ichi will take care of everything.


00:03:55.319 --> 00:03:57.695
Lately we only go in
to clean up after Ichi.


00:03:58.822 --> 00:03:59.864
Found it.


00:04:01.992 --> 00:04:03.576
I thought I told you to quit.


00:04:15.797 --> 00:04:18.341
- What the hell?
- If I can't shoot up,


00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:20.927
- Don't do that!
- you can't use my phone.


00:04:46.662 --> 00:04:47.620
Let's go.


00:05:24.658 --> 00:05:26.701
He did it again. As gross as ever.


00:05:33.208 --> 00:05:35.710
What's this guy Ichi like, anyway?


00:05:50.892 --> 00:05:52.977
Let's get started.


00:06:31.058 --> 00:06:32.016
What the hell happened here?


00:06:47.783 --> 00:06:50.743
You were guarding
the boss last night.


00:06:50.744 --> 00:06:54.038
- So was Kaneko.
- Don't try and pass the blame.


00:06:56.333 --> 00:06:58.542
Sorry. My apologies.


00:07:05.675 --> 00:07:07.718
Mr. Kaneko,
any idea where he might be?


00:07:17.020 --> 00:07:19.105
Oh, Sir! Welcome!


00:07:43.171 --> 00:07:47.466
Has Anjo really disappeared?


00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:54.181
How much money is missing?


00:07:56.226 --> 00:07:57.685
About three million yen.


00:07:59.855 --> 00:08:06.026
Then I guess Anjo took the money...
and ran off with the girl.


00:08:11.324 --> 00:08:13.784
Sir, the boss
would never do such a thing. Never.


00:08:14.369 --> 00:08:22.668
All that time he spent in jail...
must have softened his brain.


00:08:24.004 --> 00:08:26.881
A guy grows old,
gets obsessed with a broad


00:08:27.757 --> 00:08:31.510
and can't even tell
his ass from a hole in the ground.


00:08:32.137 --> 00:08:34.763
Probably some other gang
is behind it, sir.


00:08:35.140 --> 00:08:37.433
There are many who bear us a grudge.


00:08:37.601 --> 00:08:40.144
It's not Anjo who made enemies.
You did.


00:08:43.815 --> 00:08:45.149
The boss is not dead.


00:08:53.491 --> 00:08:54.617
Please excuse us.


00:10:01.142 --> 00:10:04.853
- Don't you have a girlfriend?
- No. It gets lonely, you know.


00:10:06.398 --> 00:10:09.566
- Why don't you get yourself a pet?
- I used to have an alligator.


00:10:09.859 --> 00:10:13.028
but they get hard to handle
so I flushed it down the toilet.


00:10:13.613 --> 00:10:14.613
I see.


00:10:19.786 --> 00:10:22.496
- What kind?
- A mongrel.


00:10:23.164 --> 00:10:24.540
He was so cute.


00:10:25.417 --> 00:10:27.710
But this bloke next door...


00:10:31.798 --> 00:10:33.382
He made fun of it.


00:10:33.925 --> 00:10:36.093
So I started praying.


00:10:41.891 --> 00:10:42.808
Welcome.


00:10:43.018 --> 00:10:45.477
- Is Karen here?
- She's there. Follow me.


00:10:45.478 --> 00:10:47.479
- My wish was fulfilled.
- Really?


00:10:51.109 --> 00:10:52.484
It died.


00:10:55.613 --> 00:10:56.864
It did?


00:11:07.542 --> 00:11:08.834
C'mon, have another.


00:11:10.003 --> 00:11:12.087
- Masa.
- Did you hear?


00:11:12.797 --> 00:11:14.673
The boss has disappeared.


00:11:22.766 --> 00:11:25.309
If he ran off at all
it would've been with you.


00:11:26.102 --> 00:11:27.436
Another gang has got him.


00:11:32.901 --> 00:11:34.401
What are you going to do now?


00:11:37.405 --> 00:11:39.990
He's not dead. I'll find him.


00:11:40.825 --> 00:11:41.992
I'm sure you will.


00:11:47.540 --> 00:11:49.708
Don't fool with me, Karen.


00:11:50.126 --> 00:11:52.336
He's alive. I'm dead sure of it.


00:11:52.587 --> 00:11:54.630
He's just waiting for me to find him.


00:11:56.091 --> 00:11:57.591
Yeah, but...


00:11:58.301 --> 00:12:00.094
You're the boss's woman.


00:12:00.887 --> 00:12:02.262
What are you talking about?


00:12:03.932 --> 00:12:05.015
I'm sorry.


00:12:06.768 --> 00:12:08.310
Is it a birthday party?


00:12:08.478 --> 00:12:10.854
It's my birthday.


00:12:10.855 --> 00:12:12.856
Today's your birthday?


00:12:17.570 --> 00:12:20.572
- Then this is your present.
- I thought I told you to quit.


00:12:22.826 --> 00:12:24.785
They are outcasts from the gangs.


00:12:32.127 --> 00:12:34.920
Murder, arson, smuggling and rape.


00:12:47.684 --> 00:12:50.144
How have you been?


00:12:50.562 --> 00:12:52.312
So you're back in Shinjuku, huh?


00:12:52.772 --> 00:12:55.983
This is the only place...
where guys like us can make a living.


00:12:56.568 --> 00:12:58.068
Did you hear
what happened at our place?


00:12:58.236 --> 00:13:00.487
More or less.


00:13:00.947 --> 00:13:04.074
When you hear anything,
I want to know. There'll be a reward.


00:13:04.075 --> 00:13:06.118
I see.


00:13:44.824 --> 00:13:45.949
Kill yourself.


00:13:48.953 --> 00:13:49.912
I'm sorry.


00:13:53.917 --> 00:13:55.375
I can't hear you.


00:13:59.422 --> 00:14:02.633
Hurry up and die. Hurry up and die.


00:14:03.384 --> 00:14:04.259
I'm sorry.


00:14:05.220 --> 00:14:07.179
I have no use
for your stupid apologies.


00:14:10.892 --> 00:14:11.892
Stop crying.


00:14:13.144 --> 00:14:15.479
You can shed all the tears you want.


00:14:21.152 --> 00:14:24.488
I'll only forgive you
when you're dead.


00:14:39.587 --> 00:14:41.421
You stupid son of a bitch.


00:14:41.839 --> 00:14:44.550
I don't want to hear
that you haven't found him yet.


00:14:45.635 --> 00:14:46.510
Give me that.


00:14:47.262 --> 00:14:51.431
I want you
to turn Shinjuku inside out


00:14:51.432 --> 00:14:56.061
until you find the boss!
Don't show your face until you do.


00:15:07.574 --> 00:15:11.201
Chief, so far
we haven't found any clues.


00:15:14.455 --> 00:15:18.792
That doesn't mean, of course...
that I've abandoned all hope.


00:15:18.793 --> 00:15:21.128
I'll find him. Just leave it to me.


00:15:24.507 --> 00:15:25.424
I'll get it.


00:15:36.394 --> 00:15:38.562
It's just a rumor.


00:15:38.563 --> 00:15:40.856
Hard to say how much of it is true.


00:15:42.400 --> 00:15:45.485
But the Funakis belong to
the Sanko syndicate, just like us.


00:15:46.362 --> 00:15:48.739
They even share the building with us.


00:15:48.990 --> 00:15:52.200
Exactly.
That way they can keep tabs...


00:15:52.785 --> 00:15:54.369
...on who's coming and going.


00:15:54.537 --> 00:15:57.164
- They probably staked out your boss.
- Why do that?


00:15:58.041 --> 00:16:01.084
Well, Mr. Kakihara,
three years ago you yourself...


00:16:01.085 --> 00:16:04.463
...cut Mr. Suzuki of the Funaki family
out of a porn video sales racket.


00:16:05.298 --> 00:16:08.717
Word has it that he hasn't forgotten.


00:16:10.511 --> 00:16:12.471
So, you think Suzuki
is behind all this?


00:16:12.472 --> 00:16:16.183
It's only a rumor.


00:16:17.727 --> 00:16:21.313
But behind your back
Mr. Suzuki is bad-mouthing you.


00:16:21.481 --> 00:16:23.649
He's spread
some pretty ridiculous stories.


00:16:24.359 --> 00:16:28.362
He even said
you had a crush on boss Anjo.


00:16:28.363 --> 00:16:31.657
What the hell are you talking about?


00:16:33.201 --> 00:16:35.619
Takayama, bring him here.


00:16:36.496 --> 00:16:38.705
Bring who?


00:16:39.082 --> 00:16:40.874
Suzuki, of course.


00:16:43.503 --> 00:16:44.378
But...


00:16:44.379 --> 00:16:46.046
You got cold feet?


00:16:46.214 --> 00:16:48.548
That's not the problem.


00:16:48.549 --> 00:16:50.133
We don't have any proof.


00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:54.930
Since when do you care about proof?


00:16:55.348 --> 00:16:57.933
If he lies
we'll give his corpse to Funaki.


00:17:02.814 --> 00:17:04.940
Get on with it, Takayama.


00:17:05.525 --> 00:17:06.441
OK.


00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:22.958
Jijii, go buy some shrimp.


00:17:23.710 --> 00:17:24.835
Shrimp?


00:17:42.019 --> 00:17:43.520
Kakihara?


00:17:45.982 --> 00:17:46.940
Tempura?


00:18:01.622 --> 00:18:03.331
What the hell's going on here?


00:18:09.338 --> 00:18:12.507
Kakihara! What the fuck is this?


00:18:13.634 --> 00:18:16.052
You look fantastic, Mr. Suzuki.


00:18:46.834 --> 00:18:48.043
Where is the boss?


00:18:48.878 --> 00:18:53.632
The boss? You mean Anjo?


00:18:55.259 --> 00:18:59.888
He and that girl bolted.
Made off with your money, right?


00:19:09.816 --> 00:19:11.817
You're not listening to me.


00:19:18.449 --> 00:19:19.825
Wait. Stop, damn it!


00:19:21.118 --> 00:19:25.163
You think I took boss Anjo?


00:19:26.082 --> 00:19:29.918
I know you're pissed off because
I dealt you out of that video deal.


00:19:31.212 --> 00:19:33.547
You've been going around
bad-mouthing us.


00:19:33.548 --> 00:19:35.215
No, I haven't.


00:19:35.216 --> 00:19:36.758
Yes, you have.
Ain't that right, Jijii?


00:19:38.052 --> 00:19:40.846
Who the hell are you?


00:19:41.138 --> 00:19:44.599
You say you didn't dub adult
videos behind Mr. Kakihara's back?


00:19:44.600 --> 00:19:47.686
That proves you can't be trusted.


00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:51.731
OK, it's true about the videos.
I'll admit that.


00:19:52.191 --> 00:19:54.818
But I know nothing about your boss.


00:19:54.986 --> 00:19:56.903
You have to believe me, please.


00:20:03.703 --> 00:20:06.538
I'll ask you again.
Where is the boss?


00:20:07.248 --> 00:20:10.417
I don't know. I really have no idea.


00:20:14.922 --> 00:20:17.132
- Chief, that's too...
- Wait.


00:20:18.134 --> 00:20:21.261
Hey, wait!


00:20:33.608 --> 00:20:37.569
I wonder how Jijii managed
to get a camera and a mike in there?


00:20:38.362 --> 00:20:40.071
I put them there.


00:20:40.990 --> 00:20:42.198
You did?


00:20:43.075 --> 00:20:48.455
Jijii talked me into it before
I was kicked out of the Anjo gang.


00:20:50.166 --> 00:20:52.167
So you were buddies with Kakihara?


00:20:52.627 --> 00:20:56.171
He wouldn't recognize me now.
I had a face job.


00:20:59.133 --> 00:20:59.925
Plastic surgery?


00:21:02.136 --> 00:21:04.930
Why did you choose this face?


00:21:06.432 --> 00:21:08.141
Shut up!


00:21:11.729 --> 00:21:13.813
Right, I have to make a call.


00:21:23.449 --> 00:21:25.158
You about ready to come clean?


00:21:34.210 --> 00:21:35.627
I'm going to kill all of you.


00:21:43.010 --> 00:21:44.386
Once again. Where is the boss?


00:21:48.808 --> 00:21:51.142
How would I know?


00:21:51.143 --> 00:21:53.728
Somebody's already killed him!


00:21:55.147 --> 00:21:56.481
He's still alive.


00:21:57.024 --> 00:21:58.566
So what?


00:21:59.151 --> 00:22:02.821
If you won't talk,
maybe your little one will.


00:22:04.657 --> 00:22:07.200
No. Don't do that.


00:22:08.953 --> 00:22:11.663
I'll do anything you want if you just stop!


00:22:13.416 --> 00:22:14.749
What the hell?


00:22:19.714 --> 00:22:21.423
Is that you, Suzuki?


00:22:25.219 --> 00:22:27.429
Kakihara! What the fuck
do you think you are doing?


00:22:30.766 --> 00:22:32.308
Just a little torture.


00:22:36.981 --> 00:22:38.648
What did Suzuki do?


00:22:38.983 --> 00:22:39.899
Don't!


00:22:40.818 --> 00:22:42.527
Put that away, Mr. Kaneko.


00:22:43.279 --> 00:22:44.612
Who the hell are you?


00:22:45.865 --> 00:22:49.743
You tell us first
what you are doing here, Mr. Funaki.


00:22:50.286 --> 00:22:53.663
Someone called to say Suzuki
was in big trouble with your gang.


00:22:55.791 --> 00:22:59.085
He thinks I kidnapped his boss.


00:22:59.670 --> 00:23:02.505
Suzuki would never
do such a stupid thing.


00:23:02.757 --> 00:23:04.174
Let him go.


00:23:04.884 --> 00:23:07.510
- In this together, are you?
- What?


00:23:09.930 --> 00:23:10.680
Hey!


00:23:11.932 --> 00:23:14.976
We were tipped off
that Suzuki had taken the boss.


00:23:15.144 --> 00:23:16.770
By who?


00:23:16.771 --> 00:23:18.313
That guy there...


00:23:24.278 --> 00:23:27.280
- Well, who?
- That guy Jijii.


00:23:27.573 --> 00:23:29.949
What guy?


00:23:32.161 --> 00:23:34.871
You! Go and find him!


00:23:35.039 --> 00:23:35.789
Yes sir!


00:23:47.134 --> 00:23:48.009
Hello.


00:23:53.140 --> 00:23:54.599
So you came back.


00:24:18.916 --> 00:24:21.292
You are the only one who enjoys


00:24:23.546 --> 00:24:25.171
seeing a girl's body all black-and-blue.


00:24:48.863 --> 00:24:49.654
How...


00:24:52.324 --> 00:24:53.700
What do you mean, 'how'?


00:24:54.034 --> 00:24:56.452
Tell me about the beating
you got yesterday?


00:24:57.663 --> 00:24:58.371
What do you mean?


00:25:00.457 --> 00:25:01.749
Did it hurt?


00:25:04.211 --> 00:25:08.256
I thought I was going to die.


00:25:11.927 --> 00:25:15.221
The bastard. I wish he would die.


00:25:17.600 --> 00:25:18.725
Die...


00:25:19.226 --> 00:25:22.270
Yes, I wish he would die.


00:25:30.863 --> 00:25:34.908
Shall I kill him for you?


00:25:43.250 --> 00:25:46.002
- Ten million yen?
- No, you idiot. A hundred million!


00:25:46.962 --> 00:25:50.840
That seems like a fair sum.


00:25:52.259 --> 00:25:53.885
We don't have that much.


00:25:54.553 --> 00:25:57.805
So hand the video business over to us
and that'll settle the matter.


00:25:58.432 --> 00:26:01.184
All of our money
disappeared with the boss.


00:26:01.685 --> 00:26:04.771
Take our video business too
and we'll have to fold.


00:26:05.731 --> 00:26:08.441
You think
I'd let you off that easily?


00:26:10.361 --> 00:26:14.822
Throw this guy out of the syndicate.
That makes it a lot easier.


00:26:15.532 --> 00:26:17.075
Maybe you're right.


00:26:21.288 --> 00:26:23.414
I'll make a sincere apology.


00:26:36.553 --> 00:26:39.430
This is not a matter
of cutting one or two fingers


00:26:39.640 --> 00:26:42.725
- I have a taste for sweet things.
- So what?


00:26:43.435 --> 00:26:45.728
To apologize,
I'll cut my source of pleasure.


00:26:46.689 --> 00:26:47.981
What do you mean?


00:28:12.941 --> 00:28:15.151
He-o, it's Kakiha-a.


00:28:17.488 --> 00:28:20.365
T-at you, Ka-en?


00:28:20.866 --> 00:28:26.996
Yes, all right, I'm on my way.


00:28:30.000 --> 00:28:33.461
I'm going to look for the boss.


00:28:43.430 --> 00:28:44.263
Sir!


00:28:44.681 --> 00:28:45.890
Sir!


00:28:58.404 --> 00:29:01.072
I had to stop at the hospital.


00:29:01.323 --> 00:29:02.240
The hospital?


00:29:06.078 --> 00:29:08.955
That's disgusting.


00:29:09.123 --> 00:29:10.498
Look, it's amazing.


00:29:12.584 --> 00:29:15.586
It's all right.
The human body regenerates itself.


00:29:15.587 --> 00:29:19.215
If I keep talking it'll get better, right?


00:30:05.929 --> 00:30:06.888
Who is it?


00:30:07.806 --> 00:30:10.224
It's Karen, from the Hirando club.


00:30:17.149 --> 00:30:18.774
Good morning.


00:30:18.984 --> 00:30:21.068
Have you heard from him?


00:30:22.404 --> 00:30:25.448
I don't owe you a thing
so why should I tell you anything?


00:30:25.449 --> 00:30:28.493
If you're not here to score,
just fuck off.


00:30:29.536 --> 00:30:33.706
How dare you come here empty-handed
and ask me for a favor.


00:30:33.874 --> 00:30:35.541
Who the hell do you think you are?


00:30:36.126 --> 00:30:38.169
This is Kakihara.


00:30:38.170 --> 00:30:40.505
The guy with the body piercings
from the Anjo gang.


00:30:40.506 --> 00:30:45.843
Hey, who said you could come in?


00:30:47.346 --> 00:30:49.555
I don't care who he is.


00:30:49.848 --> 00:30:52.558
I don't associate
with the likes of you.


00:30:55.646 --> 00:30:57.688
The boss is going to die.


00:30:58.440 --> 00:31:01.400
What's this guy talking about?


00:31:01.652 --> 00:31:04.111
If I don't hurry, the boss will die.


00:31:05.280 --> 00:31:09.033
Like I said, if you're not here
to score you're in the way.


00:31:09.034 --> 00:31:10.868
So get the hell out. Scram!


00:31:12.871 --> 00:31:14.747
Do you know
what'll happen if he dies?


00:31:20.921 --> 00:31:25.174
Jijii, hurry back here
and give me a hit.


00:31:41.108 --> 00:31:45.152
He was already in there
when we arrived.


00:31:45.445 --> 00:31:47.822
I taped it up
in case he tries to escape.


00:31:53.287 --> 00:31:54.829
Where's your boss, Jijii?


00:32:00.961 --> 00:32:02.086
What's this?


00:32:08.010 --> 00:32:10.303
That's our office.


00:32:12.556 --> 00:32:13.848
Look what I found.


00:32:27.946 --> 00:32:29.280
Boss Anjo...


00:32:35.245 --> 00:32:37.079
So you guys kidnapped him.


00:32:40.167 --> 00:32:41.584
Where is boss Anjo?


00:32:44.087 --> 00:32:47.548
I'll tell you
if you shoot me up first.


00:32:48.967 --> 00:32:51.594
I'm asking you. Where's the boss?


00:32:53.680 --> 00:32:55.723
He's long dead and buried.


00:32:59.436 --> 00:33:03.773
If I'm not getting a shot then hurry
up and kill me, brother Kakihara.


00:33:09.321 --> 00:33:10.529
Who are you?


00:33:11.907 --> 00:33:16.077
I know your methods.
If you're going to kill me anyway


00:33:16.078 --> 00:33:18.329
just get it over with,
brother Kakihara.


00:33:20.582 --> 00:33:22.375
Kano?


00:33:24.086 --> 00:33:25.294
Jackpot.


00:33:26.129 --> 00:33:27.129
Kano?


00:33:28.715 --> 00:33:29.882
Are you Kano?


00:33:31.468 --> 00:33:32.927
But your face is different.


00:33:38.934 --> 00:33:40.810
So you killed the boss?


00:33:41.770 --> 00:33:43.896
It was Ichi who did it.


00:33:44.898 --> 00:33:46.399
Who is this 'Ichi'?


00:33:47.234 --> 00:33:49.235
I only cleaned up after him.


00:33:50.779 --> 00:33:54.740
It seems that Ichi's next target
is you, brother Kakihara.


00:33:55.909 --> 00:33:59.870
You had the hots for Anjo,
didn't you?


00:34:00.872 --> 00:34:05.793
Not because you're queer
or because you admired his balls.


00:34:06.503 --> 00:34:08.879
It was because you relished
the pain that he inflicted


00:34:08.880 --> 00:34:12.007
when he beat you up.


00:34:12.926 --> 00:34:15.594
That's why you want
to find him so badly.


00:34:15.595 --> 00:34:18.013
Am I right?


00:34:19.057 --> 00:34:20.224
You need him to hurt you again.


00:34:41.455 --> 00:34:43.664
I'm going to get you for this.


00:34:51.047 --> 00:34:55.926
Kakihara,
I'll never forget what you did.


00:34:59.181 --> 00:35:01.640
I'm going to kill you, you bastard.


00:35:17.783 --> 00:35:20.493
What did you do with the girl?


00:35:22.245 --> 00:35:23.913
He asked where Anjo's girl is.


00:35:28.376 --> 00:35:29.752
The girl?


00:35:30.629 --> 00:35:33.923
We want the girl
you took along with Anjo.


00:35:33.924 --> 00:35:35.883
Return her to us right now.


00:35:36.718 --> 00:35:39.762
Wait a minute.


00:35:40.222 --> 00:35:43.891
You're also making a mistake.


00:35:43.892 --> 00:35:48.687
We'll kill you. If you don't say
something, we'll kill the whole gang.


00:35:48.688 --> 00:35:50.898
W-Wait!


00:35:51.650 --> 00:35:54.151
Will you listen, damn it?
I didn't do it.


00:35:54.152 --> 00:35:57.029
I've got nothing to do with it.


00:35:58.156 --> 00:35:59.198
I'm innocent.


00:36:00.283 --> 00:36:01.826
Believe me, please.


00:36:12.587 --> 00:36:15.881
Ask somebody else, please.


00:36:23.306 --> 00:36:25.850
- Time is running out.
- Time's up.


00:36:25.851 --> 00:36:29.645
What do you mean?


00:36:29.646 --> 00:36:30.354
We'll cut you here.


00:36:31.106 --> 00:36:32.898
It won't hurt much.


00:36:36.653 --> 00:36:38.529
No, please. Help!


00:36:48.665 --> 00:36:49.373
Hello?


00:36:50.625 --> 00:36:51.333
Yes.


00:36:55.755 --> 00:36:56.797
I understand.


00:37:07.267 --> 00:37:13.147
Someone says he saw a man with
a torn mouth attack Anjo's office.


00:37:17.819 --> 00:37:19.320
That's Kakihara. I knew it!


00:37:23.033 --> 00:37:25.701
I can't breathe in this mask.


00:37:27.746 --> 00:37:31.582
I should've cut the eyes
a little higher.


00:37:32.083 --> 00:37:34.460
It fogs up when I breathe.


00:37:35.545 --> 00:37:37.671
Hi Myu-Myu. How are you?


00:37:43.178 --> 00:37:45.387
This is it?


00:37:45.388 --> 00:37:46.430
Stop it!


00:37:47.140 --> 00:37:48.641
You know what I'm saying?


00:37:48.642 --> 00:37:50.100
Stop hitting me!


00:37:57.525 --> 00:37:58.859
Tell me.


00:37:59.653 --> 00:38:02.863
You can suck dicks, you have a cunt
and this is all you earn?


00:38:09.913 --> 00:38:13.582
How can I get clients
if you keep busting my face?


00:38:13.750 --> 00:38:14.959
Shut up, you bitch!


00:38:21.257 --> 00:38:22.549
How does that feel?


00:39:39.586 --> 00:39:40.627
Who the fuck are you?


00:39:52.015 --> 00:39:54.391
Come in here, you little shit.


00:39:54.934 --> 00:39:59.188
What the fuck are you doing?
Are you some kind of pervert?


00:40:00.273 --> 00:40:01.398
What the fuck is this costume?


00:40:02.525 --> 00:40:03.859
Say something.


00:40:04.944 --> 00:40:06.653
Can't you talk, asshole?


00:40:07.864 --> 00:40:08.864
I'm sorry.


00:40:09.908 --> 00:40:11.033
I'm sorry.


00:40:11.034 --> 00:40:13.285
Don't bullshit me saying "I'm sorry."


00:40:22.253 --> 00:40:23.712
Why are you crying?


00:40:28.009 --> 00:40:30.803
- I'm not crying.
- Yes, you are.


00:40:34.182 --> 00:40:37.559
- No, I'm not.
- I can see it.


00:40:42.232 --> 00:40:45.442
- You're fucking crying!
- No, I'm not!


00:41:05.380 --> 00:41:06.672
What the fuck?


00:42:00.268 --> 00:42:01.476
What did you do?


00:42:07.775 --> 00:42:10.652
I killed him for you.


00:42:25.668 --> 00:42:29.129
I promised I'd kill him for you.


00:42:34.677 --> 00:42:36.887
But don't worry.


00:42:39.098 --> 00:42:41.141
From now on I'll beat you up.


00:42:53.738 --> 00:42:56.365
You'll beat me up instead?


00:43:11.547 --> 00:43:12.631
Thank you.


00:44:33.671 --> 00:44:37.424
Kakihara, you are expelled
from the Syndicate.


00:44:41.220 --> 00:44:42.763
The Syndicate came to this decision


00:44:44.223 --> 00:44:51.396
due to the arrogance shown
in your actions and those of your men


00:44:52.899 --> 00:44:58.695
during the search for Anjo,
your torture of Suzuki


00:44:59.113 --> 00:45:05.660
and your refusal
to bargain with Funaki.


00:45:08.456 --> 00:45:11.792
Have you anything to say?


00:45:14.837 --> 00:45:16.213
Are you listening?


00:45:18.674 --> 00:45:19.800
Kakihara!


00:45:31.896 --> 00:45:33.313
Is that all you wanted to say?


00:45:37.902 --> 00:45:39.736
I guess so.


00:45:43.491 --> 00:45:45.325
Then I thank you for everything.


00:45:57.296 --> 00:45:58.964
That was a piece of cake.


00:45:59.424 --> 00:46:00.966
Hey, Suzuki.


00:46:02.343 --> 00:46:05.720
Are you sure
we're doing the right thing?


00:46:07.181 --> 00:46:09.266
It's strange
the way he took it lying down.


00:46:09.267 --> 00:46:10.559
You think he wants revenge?


00:46:13.938 --> 00:46:16.648
- I forgot to mention one thing.
- What?


00:46:17.066 --> 00:46:19.401
I'm taking over the Anjo gang.


00:46:28.661 --> 00:46:30.745
So we've been expelled?


00:46:31.539 --> 00:46:34.124
That's right.


00:46:35.209 --> 00:46:37.294
Every yakuza in Shinjuku is after us.


00:46:37.462 --> 00:46:39.337
Whoever wants out, better say now.


00:46:43.759 --> 00:46:47.387
I'm sorry.
I'd like to hand back the sake cup


00:46:47.388 --> 00:46:51.099
- with which I pledged allegiance.
- Do you, now?


00:47:39.148 --> 00:47:41.024
They expelled Kakihara.


00:47:55.289 --> 00:47:56.248
Where's the money?


00:47:56.499 --> 00:48:01.753
- I've put half into the account.
- Only half? That wasn't the deal.


00:48:02.588 --> 00:48:05.340
I'll deposit the rest
when you've carried out our deal.


00:48:06.425 --> 00:48:08.301
A million yen is a lot of money.


00:48:09.804 --> 00:48:12.597
What if you blow it?


00:48:14.809 --> 00:48:17.352
In the next three or four days


00:48:17.770 --> 00:48:21.648
you kick everyone out
of that yakuza apartment.


00:48:22.191 --> 00:48:25.318
They'll only get in the way.
Can you do it alone?


00:48:26.070 --> 00:48:27.362
Don't worry.


00:48:27.947 --> 00:48:29.656
I'll get on it right away!


00:48:30.074 --> 00:48:34.744
Make sure you squash Kakihara,
good and proper.


00:49:11.991 --> 00:49:16.578
Where are you going?
What do you want me to do?


00:49:18.039 --> 00:49:20.540
Just wait here. Don't move.


00:49:36.349 --> 00:49:37.307
Ichi...


00:49:52.281 --> 00:49:53.073
Ichi!


00:50:03.501 --> 00:50:08.505
I dreamt about Ms. Tachibana.


00:50:10.216 --> 00:50:13.843
Who helped you when they bullied you?
The girl that got raped?


00:50:16.430 --> 00:50:20.684
When they raped her
she cried for me to help her.


00:50:23.229 --> 00:50:26.731
But my legs were shaking so violently
that I couldn't move.


00:50:29.777 --> 00:50:33.196
I still dream
about how she cried out.


00:50:35.074 --> 00:50:39.494
You wanted to save Ms. Tachibana
so badly?


00:50:44.041 --> 00:50:45.458
I felt like raping her.


00:50:47.253 --> 00:50:49.003
Surely you wanted to save her?


00:50:54.218 --> 00:50:56.928
She wanted me to rape her.


00:50:57.471 --> 00:51:00.640
Ichi! Open your eyes, damn it!


00:51:04.437 --> 00:51:07.814
Why would Sailor
do such a thing to me?


00:51:09.859 --> 00:51:11.568
Who are you talking about?


00:51:12.486 --> 00:51:15.447
Why would Sailor
do such a thing to me?


00:51:18.743 --> 00:51:20.952
Get a grip on yourself, Ichi.


00:51:35.301 --> 00:51:38.011
Well? What's the matter?


00:52:02.161 --> 00:52:04.287
You've been expelled
from the Syndicate, haven't you?


00:52:04.705 --> 00:52:07.415
Letting you in puts me in jeopardy.


00:52:08.417 --> 00:52:11.336
Who do you think you're talking to?


00:52:19.637 --> 00:52:20.720
That hurts!


00:52:23.599 --> 00:52:25.433
Mr. Kakihara, please stop.


00:52:33.943 --> 00:52:37.237
You'll tear it off. It's stretching.


00:52:41.367 --> 00:52:43.535
Karen, Karen!


00:52:44.620 --> 00:52:46.996
Karen, do something, please!


00:52:47.164 --> 00:52:48.581
Help me!


00:52:54.046 --> 00:52:56.422
Karen!


00:53:03.430 --> 00:53:04.806
Can I join in?


00:53:21.115 --> 00:53:22.657
That hurts.


00:53:22.658 --> 00:53:24.033
What the hell are you doing, Karen?


00:53:30.249 --> 00:53:32.625
Masa, you know what?


00:53:33.460 --> 00:53:36.045
I want to be your woman!
We'll be happy together.


00:54:04.658 --> 00:54:09.078
Take off your shoes!
You're so fucking slow!


00:54:11.373 --> 00:54:15.043
- Hurry up.
- Go and get it.


00:54:16.170 --> 00:54:17.837
Get a move on.


00:54:21.175 --> 00:54:23.384
- Hey, give it back to me.
- What?


00:54:27.640 --> 00:54:33.895
Your father got fired from the police
because he lost his gun.


00:54:34.647 --> 00:54:36.648
What an idiot.


00:54:36.649 --> 00:54:38.566
He's as big an idiot as his dad.


00:54:38.567 --> 00:54:40.944
Those guns are paid for
with tax money.


00:54:41.278 --> 00:54:43.821
Give us our money back, asshole.


00:54:44.323 --> 00:54:44.906
Here!


00:54:59.338 --> 00:55:02.298
Hurry up and bring it back.


00:55:04.969 --> 00:55:07.845
Hurry up and bring it back.


00:55:12.977 --> 00:55:15.103
Can't you hear what I'm saying?


00:55:26.991 --> 00:55:27.949
Hey, you.


00:55:31.453 --> 00:55:32.620
Quit staring.


00:55:34.039 --> 00:55:34.956
Get lost, you jerk.


00:56:01.984 --> 00:56:04.861
You want to be my woman, don't you?


00:56:05.237 --> 00:56:06.362
Then give it to me
like you did before.


00:56:07.573 --> 00:56:09.949
- Does that hurt?
- Keep going.


00:56:16.206 --> 00:56:18.708
Listen, when you're hurting someone


00:56:19.209 --> 00:56:22.587
don't think of the pain
that he feels.


00:56:24.715 --> 00:56:28.259
Only concentrate
on the pleasure of causing him pain.


00:56:29.636 --> 00:56:32.680
That's the only way to show
true compassion for your partner.


00:56:57.247 --> 00:56:59.248
It's OK.
Do it like you want to kill me.


00:57:00.667 --> 00:57:03.002
The boss was a lot better at this.


00:57:21.605 --> 00:57:22.730
That's enough.


00:57:27.236 --> 00:57:28.611
You let me down.


00:57:31.365 --> 00:57:34.283
Hey, come back!


00:57:48.257 --> 00:57:49.715
These guys need to be killed.


00:57:53.053 --> 00:57:57.056
Go in fast, and finish them off.


00:57:58.058 --> 00:58:01.102
- I can't.
- Sure you can.


00:58:01.436 --> 00:58:04.689
They're all bullies. They work for
the guy you killed before.


00:58:06.191 --> 00:58:08.025
It's easy. Just go in
and do your thing.


00:58:08.861 --> 00:58:12.738
- No way. There's too many of them.
- Come on, Ichi.


00:58:13.448 --> 00:58:14.907
You want revenge, don't you?


00:58:15.492 --> 00:58:18.411
Weren't you going to rid the world
of all the bullies?


00:58:20.455 --> 00:58:22.623
Those guys extort money
from the poor.


00:58:22.958 --> 00:58:25.626
They beat up on the weak
and pretend to own the world.


00:58:26.086 --> 00:58:28.087
Vengeance is yours.


00:58:30.716 --> 00:58:32.717
See the guy with the shaved head?


00:58:33.552 --> 00:58:37.346
Doesn't he look like
that kid Imamura...


00:58:37.848 --> 00:58:39.640
who bullied you back in high school?


00:58:41.310 --> 00:58:43.144
And isn't the guy next to him


00:58:43.520 --> 00:58:45.479
the spitting image of that kid Tokito


00:58:45.480 --> 00:58:48.107
who scribbled all over
your textbooks?


00:58:50.527 --> 00:58:52.612
Well, Ichi?


00:58:57.075 --> 00:58:58.075
It does look like him.


00:59:49.544 --> 00:59:51.420
You must take revenge.


00:59:51.964 --> 00:59:53.673
Killing is bad.


00:59:55.217 --> 00:59:57.009
I told you not to worry.


00:59:57.344 --> 00:59:59.428
They're just a big bunch of bullies.


01:00:01.556 --> 01:00:03.057
The people I just killed


01:00:03.392 --> 01:00:05.351
were not the ones
who used to bully me.


01:00:07.688 --> 01:00:10.398
They're bad people.
Of course they had to die.


01:00:11.066 --> 01:00:12.900
How did it feel today?


01:00:15.070 --> 01:00:16.779
I don't want to kill any more.


01:00:18.615 --> 01:00:20.449
Don't be a fool.


01:00:21.201 --> 01:00:23.661
If you don't kill the bad guys,
who will?


01:00:26.331 --> 01:00:27.748
I don't want to kill.


01:00:29.668 --> 01:00:32.128
You'll go on killing, won't you?


01:00:33.297 --> 01:00:34.297
I don't want to any more.


01:00:35.757 --> 01:00:36.924
Kill the bad guys.


01:00:39.052 --> 01:00:39.927
Kill.


01:01:20.635 --> 01:01:24.430
Thank you for protecting me
back there.


01:01:29.603 --> 01:01:30.728
What's wrong?


01:01:31.396 --> 01:01:32.396
Are you all right?


01:01:38.153 --> 01:01:39.487
What's your name?


01:01:42.366 --> 01:01:43.240
Ichi.


01:01:46.119 --> 01:01:47.495
We're friends, aren't we?


01:02:30.539 --> 01:02:31.831
Shit.


01:02:37.546 --> 01:02:39.547
What the hell happened?


01:02:42.843 --> 01:02:45.386
Chief, what happened?


01:02:48.390 --> 01:02:50.766
He showed up, finally.


01:02:51.768 --> 01:02:53.644
Isn't this amazing?


01:02:54.312 --> 01:02:56.522
I'm scared.


01:02:56.523 --> 01:02:59.275
Hey, all of you! Don't run away!


01:02:59.276 --> 01:03:02.319
Everyone is bolting!


01:03:08.076 --> 01:03:09.118
You're not running?


01:03:11.705 --> 01:03:15.499
Not until we avenge the boss.


01:03:17.252 --> 01:03:18.210
Well...


01:03:19.671 --> 01:03:25.217
This is really something.


01:03:31.850 --> 01:03:32.892
Look at this.


01:03:34.019 --> 01:03:38.063
The human body is made out of a
single tube like this.


01:03:38.273 --> 01:03:40.107
I'm sorry, chief.


01:03:40.400 --> 01:03:41.650
They've all gone.


01:03:42.110 --> 01:03:43.152
Don't bother.


01:03:44.404 --> 01:03:47.281
Takayama, call the East Shinjuku
police station.


01:03:49.201 --> 01:03:53.954
- You're reporting this?
- No, I'll get them to help us.


01:04:51.471 --> 01:04:56.600
I was being bullied when this strong
guy turned up and kicked their asses.


01:04:58.228 --> 01:05:01.855
You do karate and all that stuff,
don't you?


01:05:04.568 --> 01:05:05.776
Teach me, too.


01:05:08.738 --> 01:05:13.450
- Go back home.
- I'll grow strong and get revenge.


01:05:15.620 --> 01:05:16.370
Takeshi.


01:05:18.248 --> 01:05:19.123
Takeshi!


01:05:27.757 --> 01:05:30.009
I'm on a very important job now.


01:05:31.845 --> 01:05:34.972
It may be that one day
I won't be able to come home.


01:05:36.266 --> 01:05:37.933
If something should happen to me,


01:05:37.934 --> 01:05:41.270
promise me you'll go and live
with your mom.


01:05:42.272 --> 01:05:43.272
I won't.


01:05:46.943 --> 01:05:48.402
Don't worry.


01:05:50.572 --> 01:05:52.615
I can take care of myself.


01:06:02.042 --> 01:06:02.875
Takeshi.


01:06:08.298 --> 01:06:11.175
What's taking you so long?
Go and find Ichi.


01:06:14.721 --> 01:06:17.473
I don't know what he looks like.


01:06:21.394 --> 01:06:22.811
Find anyone who smells of blood.


01:06:26.941 --> 01:06:28.651
Now go and get him!


01:06:54.761 --> 01:06:56.720
What the fuck
do you think you're doing?


01:06:57.430 --> 01:06:59.807
Hey, you got it?


01:07:00.517 --> 01:07:02.059
First you puke all over
one of our girls


01:07:03.269 --> 01:07:05.229
and then you say you've no money?


01:07:09.526 --> 01:07:11.610
Who the fuck do you think you are?


01:07:12.070 --> 01:07:13.153
Answer me, you bastard.


01:07:17.575 --> 01:07:19.118
What's so funny?


01:07:19.994 --> 01:07:23.580
Give us our money back right now.


01:07:24.374 --> 01:07:27.042
Just sell off your kidneys.


01:07:27.210 --> 01:07:27.751
Hey!


01:07:28.920 --> 01:07:30.629
As long as we get our money, asshole.


01:07:34.801 --> 01:07:36.427
How much does he owe you?


01:07:38.972 --> 01:07:40.472
Who the hell are you, anyway?


01:07:40.974 --> 01:07:42.516
How much did he borrow?


01:07:43.935 --> 01:07:44.977
500,000 yen.


01:07:48.523 --> 01:07:51.817
- Who do you work for?
- None of your business.


01:07:54.112 --> 01:07:56.280
Watch your mouth.


01:07:57.157 --> 01:08:00.617
What are you looking at?


01:08:02.829 --> 01:08:04.163
Hasn't he had enough?


01:08:08.460 --> 01:08:11.295
In that case,
why don't you pay off his debts?


01:08:13.339 --> 01:08:16.133
Watch out, or you'll get hurt.


01:08:16.426 --> 01:08:19.178
- What gang are you with?
- The Anjo gang.


01:08:25.226 --> 01:08:27.561
I don't know what backwater
you're from,


01:08:29.564 --> 01:08:31.565
but you have "sitting duck"
written all over your forehead.


01:08:37.447 --> 01:08:38.864
Aren't you Japanese?


01:08:40.116 --> 01:08:42.534
Don't you understand
what I am saying?


01:08:47.791 --> 01:08:50.834
Anyhow, get out of here.


01:08:53.838 --> 01:08:54.838
Get a move on, I said.


01:09:19.405 --> 01:09:23.283
Don't be shy. Eat up.


01:09:37.048 --> 01:09:42.719
Boss Anjo, he's the cop
who lost his gun.


01:09:43.596 --> 01:09:46.974
He became known as
an Olympic marksman.


01:09:55.483 --> 01:09:57.067
You must be hungry.


01:09:57.360 --> 01:09:59.236
Go ahead and eat.


01:10:05.702 --> 01:10:08.704
Mom won't come back, will she?


01:10:14.544 --> 01:10:17.921
She left you for another man.


01:10:25.138 --> 01:10:29.182
