looks down on me.


01:49:50.960 --> 01:49:52.669
I can do it!


01:49:53.212 --> 01:49:56.214
I'm sure I can kill Ichi. Ichi!


01:50:05.015 --> 01:50:06.015
My brother.


01:50:33.502 --> 01:50:34.585
Who's there?


01:50:41.218 --> 01:50:44.053
Saburo, what kind of guy
is this Ichi?


01:50:44.346 --> 01:50:48.433
- He must be some kind of monster.
- I'm scared.


01:50:48.434 --> 01:50:51.436
Even the infamous Kakihara
is scared now?


01:50:51.437 --> 01:50:53.438
No, I'm scared of myself.


01:50:55.357 --> 01:50:56.983
All this anticipation.


01:50:57.484 --> 01:51:00.236
It's been years since I felt such
a mix of anxiety and anticipation.


01:51:00.779 --> 01:51:03.865
The few times I've felt this,
I was let down in the end.


01:51:04.825 --> 01:51:06.993
I really want to lose myself
in desperation.


01:51:07.453 --> 01:51:09.495
What if Ichi also lets me down?


01:51:09.955 --> 01:51:10.997
What's the matter?


01:51:11.540 --> 01:51:15.209
- It's Jiro. He's dead.
- Really?


01:51:15.210 --> 01:51:19.255
It's exactly the same feeling
as when our big brother Ichiro died.


01:51:19.798 --> 01:51:21.841
Are you sure? Then let's go back.


01:51:24.261 --> 01:51:26.721
Kaneko. Ichi has arrived.


01:52:12.351 --> 01:52:13.434
Damn.


01:52:14.269 --> 01:52:17.063
I was looking forward to
killing Jiro myself one day.


01:52:19.566 --> 01:52:23.653
That's interesting.


01:52:38.919 --> 01:52:39.961
Oh, fuck!


01:52:48.971 --> 01:52:50.513
The same as ever.


01:53:09.992 --> 01:53:10.741
Takeshi.


01:53:12.035 --> 01:53:12.827
What is it?


01:53:31.221 --> 01:53:32.889
He looks like that guy...


01:53:33.599 --> 01:53:36.058
He's called Ichi.


01:53:36.727 --> 01:53:38.769
- What did you say?
- Ichi.


01:53:39.146 --> 01:53:41.355
He's the guy who used karate
to help me.


01:53:47.196 --> 01:53:50.823
Damn! Damn!


01:53:51.408 --> 01:53:52.158
Takeshi.


01:53:54.745 --> 01:53:57.788
Don't move an inch.


01:54:43.126 --> 01:54:45.253
Wait a minute.


01:54:45.587 --> 01:54:48.631
You're scaring me. Wait.


01:54:56.890 --> 01:55:01.227
You're so fucking scary!
You're coming at me again?


01:55:01.645 --> 01:55:02.353
Ichi!


01:55:27.045 --> 01:55:27.670
Hey.


01:55:30.424 --> 01:55:31.007
Hey.


01:55:37.180 --> 01:55:39.765
What will you do now?


01:55:42.561 --> 01:55:43.269
Hey!


01:55:45.230 --> 01:55:47.064
Don't let me down.


01:55:49.192 --> 01:55:49.942
Hey!


01:55:53.697 --> 01:55:55.740
Why are you doing this to me,
brother?


01:55:58.744 --> 01:55:59.577
Why?


01:56:03.040 --> 01:56:03.914
Why?


01:56:07.586 --> 01:56:08.461
Why?


01:56:08.629 --> 01:56:10.004
Hey, wait a minute.


01:56:13.300 --> 01:56:14.467
Hey!


01:56:14.468 --> 01:56:17.637
Tell me, brother.


01:56:19.890 --> 01:56:21.140
Tell me.


01:56:23.435 --> 01:56:23.976
Stop!


01:56:25.479 --> 01:56:26.520
Why?


01:56:29.274 --> 01:56:30.191
Why?


01:56:32.653 --> 01:56:34.111
Why, brother?


01:56:34.988 --> 01:56:36.364
Stop right there!


01:57:19.991 --> 01:57:20.866
Daddy.


01:57:28.125 --> 01:57:29.583
Takeshi...


01:57:35.841 --> 01:57:37.299
Takeshi...


01:58:12.335 --> 01:58:13.377
I'm sorry.


01:58:19.551 --> 01:58:20.593
I'm sorry.


01:58:40.489 --> 01:58:42.615
Your mind is in chaos.


01:58:44.493 --> 01:58:46.327
You are truly demented.


01:58:48.789 --> 01:58:49.872
Get up, Ichi.


01:58:51.333 --> 01:58:52.583
Get up.


01:58:56.254 --> 01:58:57.463
Get up, Ichi.


01:58:57.464 --> 01:59:00.090
What's the matter with you?


01:59:03.011 --> 01:59:05.054
Come on, damn it!


01:59:16.608 --> 01:59:18.108
Do you hear me?


01:59:22.197 --> 01:59:22.822
Get up.


01:59:32.874 --> 01:59:34.083
Come on.


01:59:40.215 --> 01:59:41.924
Stop fucking around.


01:59:45.637 --> 01:59:47.388
What are you playing at?


01:59:50.809 --> 01:59:54.854
How can we have our challenge match,
if you act this way?


01:59:57.440 --> 01:59:59.483
Come on, Ichi.


02:00:01.444 --> 02:00:03.320
Come on, Ichi.


02:00:03.321 --> 02:00:08.701
Get up and fight. Come on.


02:00:13.081 --> 02:00:13.789
Come on!


02:00:45.739 --> 02:00:48.115
You're so selfish.


02:00:50.035 --> 02:00:51.493
What are you doing?


02:01:34.120 --> 02:01:35.996
Damn...


02:01:42.295 --> 02:01:44.546
Nobody left to kill me.


02:03:38.161 --> 02:03:41.955
Wow, this is amazing!


02:03:42.415 --> 02:03:44.124
Ichi!

